## R6(a) — MUTE rationale in store.mutes.reason ✅ (store print shown this time)
Root cause found: `store.migrate()` rebuilt mutes from the muted-flag with `reason:"imported muted flag"` and dropped date/home/away. Fixed: migrate now **carries existing mutes verbatim** (no-abolition) and only creates a fallback entry (with full fields) for muted rows with no carried entry.

**Store print (from the final file, `PR.store.load().mutes`):**
```json
[
  { "date": "2024-12-01", "home": "Zenit St Petersburg", "away": "Krylia Sovetov Samara",
    "reason": "integrity: market-flagged favorite collapse (IA-02)", "sourceId": "src-integrity-2026" },
  { "date": "2024-12-07", "home": "Zenit St Petersburg", "away": "Akron Tolyatti",
    "reason": "integrity: market-flagged favorite collapse (IA-01)", "sourceId": "src-integrity-2026" },
  { "date": "2025-04-11", "home": "Spartak Moscow", "away": "Dynamo Makhachkala",
    "reason": "integrity: market-flagged favorite collapse (IA-03)", "sourceId": "src-integrity-2026" }
]
```
Pin: `smoke_test_v3.js` — `R6a: mute reasons carry the IA pack rationale (store print)` asserts all 3 reasons match `/IA-0[123]/` and contain "integrity". PASS.

